# OVERVIEW
- This version includes several bug fixes and a few visual tweaks (such as a new aurora borealis).

# General changes:
- Ice now has a "relief" effect on reflections.
- Small optimizations made on code.
- DH chunks texture now has bigger pixels.
- Cherry leaves are now pinker.
- Leaves are slightly brighter in general.
- Changes in colors to reduce excessive contrast and saturation.
- Shaded upside block faces are now more blue.
- Reworked aurora borealis.
- New language: Russian, by ShallIMove.

# Bugfixes:
- Fixed POM shadows having broken transitions.
- Fixed failure when using LabPBR on Nether.
- Fixed sky being dark when entering caves above sea level.
- Fixed Depth of Field not working properly.
- Fixed some visual issues with Block reflection. (SSR and MAX)
- Fixed Subsurface scattering (leaves transparency) not working.
- Fixed POM shadow appearing at shaded areas.
- Fixed a bug that made daytime look wrong at multiplayer servers at 26.x above.
- Fixed some issues with translucency.
- Fixed too bright entities on fire.
- Fixed compilation failure on Vanilla color scheme.

